      <li>Check valve added upstream of atomizing nozzle — prevents 90 PSI boiler pressure pushing backward into EWI accumulator between injection pulses — critical protection for EWI system</li>
      <li>Piston exhaust PCW valves added — one per piston — PID controller manages timing — opens at end of power stroke — closes before next intake — automated back pressure management</li>
      <li>Steam trap on exhaust side — positioned between piston exhaust PCW valve and expansion buffer — separates condensate from exhaust steam — prevents water hammer in exhaust piping</li>
      <li>Expansion buffer chamber 0.5L SS vessel — exhaust steam expands into buffer after trap — pressure drops before condenser inlet — reduces back pressure the piston sees at exhaust</li>
      <li>Halloween steam whistle tapped from main steam line before PCW inlet valves — multi-chime — driver pull cord — vents to atmosphere — mandatory Phase 23 feature</li>
      <li>Dome rivets only for Phase 23 first build — uniform dome size throughout bowl — easier machining — zoned cone/dome geometry deferred to Phase 24 RSR performance variant</li>
