  <p class="section-lead">Drivetrain unchanged from Phase 21. Speed and torque estimates unchanged. Key Phase 23 improvements are cold start time, throttle response, back pressure management, and steam system reliability. The exhaust PCW valve system and expansion buffer give the PID controller live back pressure data for continuous optimization. Vehicle weight slightly reduced from Phase 22 — no pyramid internal structure, simpler bowl reduces internal component mass by approximately 0.5 to 1 kg.</p>

