    <ul>
      <li>Amber driveshaft FEA at highest load diff crossing must be completed and confirmed safe before any moving vehicle test — this was flagged in Phase 21 and must not be skipped</li>
      <li>Heater feedthrough pressure test to 200 PSI minimum must be completed before first steam operation of the Aegis Boiler</li>
      <li>PID system must complete a full static bench test — boiler pressure, exhaust valve timing, EWI injection, all sensors — before the vehicle moves under steam power</li>
      <li>Halloween whistle must be tested at full operating pressure before road use — confirm the multi-chime valve seals correctly when closed and vents correctly when open</li>
